        "original_id": "47d2556b-85a2-50d6-8047-d65600f67a49",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Suresh Peters, S. Shankar, S.P. Venkatesh, K. T. Kunjumon\n- Films: Gentleman, Punjabi House\n- Songs: Chikku Bukku Rayile, Style\n- Roles: music director, playback rapper/singer, film composer, director\n- Awards: Filmfare Best Director Award, Tamil Nadu State Film Award for Best Director\n\nFacts:\n- In 1993, S. Shankar made his directorial debut with the film \"Gentleman,\" which was produced by K. T. Kunjumon.\n- In 1993, S. Shankar received the Filmfare Best Director Award and the Tamil Nadu State Film Award for Best Director for \"Gentleman.\"\n- In 1993, \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" was a Tamil song featured in the film \"Gentleman.\"\n- Suresh Peters is an Indian film music director and playback rapper/singer.\n- Suresh Peters's notable songs include \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" from \"Gentleman\" and \"Style\" from a film with an unspecified title in this chunk.\n- In the film \"Punjabi House,\" Suresh Peters composed the songs as his debut as a film composer, while S.P. Venkatesh composed the score.",
